<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in moderate trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 138.88 to 7,194.67.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 5.21 to 432.44.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell 51 cents.</p>
<p>Declines outnumbered advances 1,432 to 979.</p>
<p>Volume was 485,777,650 compared with 458,142,630 on Thursday.</p>
